WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:04.079
Cora watched the fringeheads fighting.

2
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.092
It was a very loud battle.

3
00:00:08.093 --> 00:00:11.345
"I must stop this!" Cora thought.

4
00:00:11.346 --> 00:00:22.923
She waved to Mo. "Come on!"

5
00:00:22.924 --> 00:00:32.419
Cora and Mo swam to the compass shell.

6
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:37.131
The shell opened and showed a clam.

7
00:00:37.132 --> 00:00:39.548
Mo shook his head.

8
00:00:39.549 --> 00:00:43.359
"How will a clam stop a battle?" he said.

9
00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:50.475
Cora shrugged. "I guess we'll find out."

10
00:00:50.476 --> 00:00:58.019
The friends followed the arrow.

11
00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:00.535
Finally it stopped.

12
00:01:00.536 --> 00:01:03.482
It pointed down at the seafloor.

13
00:01:03.483 --> 00:01:08.009
Cora saw tiny bubbles rise from the sand.

14
00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:14.392
Then a clam popped up.

15
00:01:14.393 --> 00:01:17.168
"Hello!" Cora said.

16
00:01:17.169 --> 00:01:19.996
"Eep!" the clam said.

17
00:01:19.997 --> 00:01:24.558
The clam dove back into the sand.

18
00:01:24.559 --> 00:01:27.290
"Don't be afraid," Mo said.

19
00:01:27.291 --> 00:01:30.831
"We're nice!"

20
00:01:30.832 --> 00:01:38.155
"And we need your help," Cora said.

21
00:01:38.156 --> 00:01:42.186
"M-my help?" the clam said.

22
00:01:42.187 --> 00:01:47.279
"Yes," Cora said. "What's your name?"

23
00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:50.594
"C-Clive," the clam said.

24
00:01:50.595 --> 00:01:53.591
"I'm Cora," she said.

25
00:01:53.592 --> 00:01:58.150
Mo flipped upside down. "I'm Mo!"

26
00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:01.348
Clive finally smiled.

27
00:02:01.349 --> 00:02:05.339
"Two fringeheads are fighting," Cora said.

28
00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:08.045
"We need your help to stop them."

29
00:02:08.046 --> 00:02:13.469
"S-stop a fight?" Clive shivered in his shell.

30
00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:19.899
"How can a clam stop a fight?"

